nd cancellations are made through Hyatt.com \n\u2022  The colleague must be the person checking into the hotel \n\u2022  All reservations must be made in the colleague\u2019s name \n\u2022  Resort fees will not be charged on complimentary room reservations \n\u2022  Colleagues may be required to pay local taxes or fees incurred \n\n*For a complete list of Terms & Conditions, please review the Colleague Complimentary Rooms Policy \n\nConfidential Proprietary Information Notice \nThe information contained herein is confidential and proprietary of Hyatt Corporation and its affiliated management and franchise companies and \nshould not be reproduced or distributed without their express authorization.\n\n---\n\n[SOURCE: privacy_policy.txt.txt]\nPrivacy Policy\n\nWe value your privacy. Your personal information, such as your name, address, and payment details, is securely stored and never sold to third parties. We use your data only to process your orders and improve your shopping experience. Cookies may be used to personalize content and track preferences. You can opt out of cookies at any time through your browser settings. For any privacy-related concerns, please contact: privacy@trendify.com\n\n---\n\n[SOURCE: source]\nHYALT\n\nColleague Complimentary Rate Booking Procedures\nQuick Reference Guide\n\nThe Colleague Complimentary Rate is booked through the Colleague Discount Room\nAvailability tool on hyattconnect. Please refer to the Colleague Complimentary Rooms Policy\nfor the complete terms and conditions of this benefit. Use the following directions to check availability or make a reservation:\n\n1. Login to hyattconnect using your Hyatt email or Global ID and Password:\n\nHYATT\"\nSign in\n\nCan't access your account? Trouble signing in? Remember to use GID @login.hyatt if you do not\nhave a Hyatt email address. Ifyou need further assistance, please contact your IT\nManager or the Global Hyatt Service Desk at: 1-844-\n473-8324 (North America) or +1-312-690-6888\n(Globa. 2. Click the Colleague Discount Room Availability link in the \u201cmy apps\u201d section on the\nhyattconnect homepage:\n\nfilter applications below Q\n\nServiceNow\n\nount Room\n\nInternal Job Postings\n\nMy Hyatt Rewards\n\nConfidential Proprietary Information Notice\nThe information contained herein is confidential and proprietary of Hyatt Corporation and its affiliated management and franchise companies and\nshould not be reproduced or distributed without their express authorization. H T\n\n3. Type the DESTINATION. 4. Type the ARRIVAL DATE and STAY LENGTH. 5. Select the Colleague Comp radio button. 6. Click CHECK AVAILABILITY. Destination Arrival Date\n\n#3 0109/2022 Saal:\n\n2 What Type of Rate? (1)\n\nQ colleague Comp @ Friends & Famil\n\n(-T +) eo eo eo @ colleague Rate @ gue Busine:\n\n7. Availability for colleague complimentary rooms for the selected dates and area hotels will\ndisplay. 8.\n\nAdditional memory from previous sessions:\n- user_name: User introduced as Burak\n- user_name: User introduced as saying\n- user_name: User introduced as Burak"
